#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the computer opponent to be <guilabel>Player 1</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Player 2</guilabel> or both. Normally you would set the computer "
"to play one player and you would play the other. Player 1 always starts "
"first."
msgstr ""

